# Normalise line endings.
#
# Git is configured with core.autocrlf=true on this machine, which would hand a
# fresh clone CRLF working-tree files. Prettier is pinned to endOfLine "lf", so
# without this file `npm run format:check` would fail immediately after cloning.
# Pinning eol=lf keeps the working tree, the repository and Prettier in
# agreement on every machine.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.keystore binary
*.apk binary
*.aab binary
